ing/region, CIDRs, BGP, security, routes, MTU, DNS/NTP and licensing require review.&lt;br&gt;OCI creates optional SDDC/DRG/attachment/partner VCs; existing VCN/subnets/VLANs, NSX routing and firewall policy remain external.&lt;br&gt;AVS-to-Oracle Global Reach is a proposed pairing requiring vendor confirmation. A VNet gateway does not transit two circuits; onprem needs independent cloud legs.&lt;br&gt;No site pairing, guest VM, package, database, backup, replication or automatic failover is deployed. Complete source inventory and input pages accompany this overview." style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#FCFBFA;strokeColor=#9E9892;fontColor=#312D2A;fontSize=10;spacing=6;fontFamily=Oracle Sans,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20.00" y="1630.00" width="2940.00" height="155.00" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n65" value="Review 2026-10-28 / local schema, isolated mocked wrapper plans and Bicep compilation only. No paid activation, cloud deployment, HCX session, migration or application test." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=13;fontColor=#312D2A;fontFamily=Oracle Sans,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20.00" y="1820.00" width="2940.00" height="60.00" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n11" value="External registration / supported versions" style="html=1;endArrow=open;endFill=0;startFill=0;rounded=0;endSize=6;startSize=6;strokeColor=#312D2A;fontSize=10;fontColor=#312D2A;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;fontFamily=Oracle Sans,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;dashed=1;exitX=0.5;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=1;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n9" target="n4"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n12" value="External HCX routing / scoped rules" style="html=1;endArrow=open;endFill=0;startFill=0;rounded=0;endSize=6;startSize=6;strokeColor=#312D2A;fontSize